%%{init: { 'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'background': '#ffffff' } }}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ClientApp
    participant Browser
    participant AuthServer
    participant ResourceAPI

    Note over User,ResourceAPI: OAuth2 Authorization Code Flow

    User->>ClientApp: Click Login
    ClientApp->>Browser: Redirect to /oauth2/authorize
    
    Browser->>AuthServer: GET /oauth2/authorize
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Validate client_id
    
    alt User Not Authenticated
        AuthServer->>Browser: Show Biometric Login
        Browser->>User: Prompt Biometric
        User->>Browser: Authenticate
        Browser->>AuthServer: POST /auth/login/verify
        AuthServer->>AuthServer: Verify Credential
    end
    
    AuthServer->>Browser: Show Consent Screen
    Browser->>User: Display Permissions
    User->>Browser: Click Allow
    
    Browser->>AuthServer: POST /oauth2/authorize/consent
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Generate Auth Code
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Store code in DB
    
    AuthServer->>Browser: Redirect with code
    Browser->>ClientApp: GET /callback?code=xxx
    
    ClientApp->>AuthServer: POST /oauth2/token
    
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Validate Code
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Validate Client
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Generate Tokens
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Delete Code
    
    AuthServer->>ClientApp: Return Tokens
    ClientApp->>ClientApp: Store Tokens
    ClientApp->>User: Login Successful
    
    Note over User,ResourceAPI: Using Access Token
    
    User->>ClientApp: Request Data
    ClientApp->>ResourceAPI: GET /api/data + Bearer Token
    
    ResourceAPI->>AuthServer: Validate Token
    AuthServer->>ResourceAPI: Token Valid
    ResourceAPI->>ClientApp: Return Data
    ClientApp->>User: Display Data
    
    Note over User,ResourceAPI: Token Refresh
    
    ClientApp->>ClientApp: Token Expired
    ClientApp->>AuthServer: POST /oauth2/token + refresh_token
    
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Validate Refresh Token
    AuthServer->>AuthServer: Generate New Token
    AuthServer->>ClientApp: Return New Token
    ClientApp->>ClientApp: Update Token
